                        <field name="dc_title">The Hon. Mr. Governor and Captain General of this EgGobernador and Reyno, he tells me the following: Having come to understand that by the Secretariat of this Captaincy General different gratifications are required to the Corregadores de los Partidos, and Justicias de los Pueblos because of the printed Circulars sent to them, that they are also distributed a number of Passports, for which they are also imposed a certain amount; [Printed text] </field>
